{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37144","headline":"泛香亭 · 郑损","name":"泛香亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流杯处处称佳致，何似斯亭出自然。\n山溜穿云来几里，石盘和藓凿何年。\n声交鸣玉歌沈板，色幌寒金酒满船。\n莫怪坐中难得醉，醒人心骨有潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}